From: BanaNAS <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] colors: BanaNAS palette

Match the splash image's tropical/teal/yellow palette: warm cream
background bleeds into the logo's edges, banana-yellow progress fill
on a darker trough so the bar reads at a glance against the splash.

---
 psplash-colors.h | 8 ++++----
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/psplash-colors.h b/psplash-colors.h
index 1111111..2222222 100644
--- a/psplash-colors.h
+++ b/psplash-colors.h
@@ -12,16 +12,16 @@
 #ifndef _HAVE_PSPLASH_COLORS_H
 #define _HAVE_PSPLASH_COLORS_H

-/* This is the overall background color */
-#define PSPLASH_BACKGROUND_COLOR 0xec,0xec,0xe1
+/* BanaNAS: matches the cream-yellow halo behind the logo */
+#define PSPLASH_BACKGROUND_COLOR 0xff,0xf6,0xd6

-/* This is the color of any text output */
-#define PSPLASH_TEXT_COLOR 0x6d,0x6d,0x70
+/* Dark teal — readable on the cream bg, matches the logo's leaves */
+#define PSPLASH_TEXT_COLOR 0x12,0x4a,0x52

-/* This is the color of the progress bar indicator */
-#define PSPLASH_BAR_COLOR 0x6d,0x6d,0x70
+/* Banana yellow */
+#define PSPLASH_BAR_COLOR 0xf2,0xc0,0x35

-/* This is the color of the progress bar background */
-#define PSPLASH_BAR_BACKGROUND_COLOR 0xec,0xec,0xe1
+/* Bar trough — slightly deeper than the bg for contrast */
+#define PSPLASH_BAR_BACKGROUND_COLOR 0xc8,0xb8,0x7f

 #endif
